launch := 2026-09-20T10:00:00-04:00 = 2026-09-20 10:00:00 -04:00
- Standup @at(tomorrow)
- Launch party @at(launch)
* Dentist @at(2026-09-17T09:00:00-04:00)
Broken @at(nope)
- [ ] Pack @at(2026-09-18) @due(2026-09-17) → due tomorrow · → at 2026-09-18
- Pairing @at(tomorrow) @left(2h) 2h left
- Review @left(-1h) ?
Plain @due(tomorrow) is prose.
- Call @
